t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta正式开源30B稠密多模态模型Muse Glimmer并支持本地部署</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic科研版Claude挑战黎曼猜想，将zeta函数零点比例下界提升至67.2%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic与Riot签署91亿美元算力长单，锁定至2048年</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达研发KV缓存跨模型迁移技术，推理预填充阶段提速至多25倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达研究团队近日取得技术突破，实现了KV缓存（Key-Value Cache）在不同LLM模型间的直接迁移。该方案允许目标模型跳过耗时的预填充（Prefill）阶段，直接复用源模型计算出的缓存数据，转换速度较重新处理上下文提升2.7倍至25倍，具体增幅取决于模型架构与上下文复杂度。传统LLM推理中，KV缓存仅限单模型使用，模型切换或版本升级需重新计算上下文，导致大量算力浪费。英伟达此项研究通过转换机制打破了缓存的“模型壁垒”，使长文本处理场景下的上下文复用成为可能。该技术有望显著降低AI推理基础设施的计算成本，优化长对话与长文档处理的响应效率，并推动模型切换与升级过程的平滑化，对提升LLM API的经济性与交互流畅度具有重要行业价值。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 发布 GPT-5.6-Cyber 模型并扩展 Daybreak 网络安全计划</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/20f8825c2191b973a2745045b0455298.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 正式推出专为网络安全设计的 GPT-5.6-Cyber 模型，并扩展 Daybreak 网络安全计划。该模型基于 GPT-5.6 Sol 构建，专门针对零日漏洞发现与漏洞利用链开发进行训练，在内部高级网络安全完成率评估中达到 95%，远超前代产品。实战中，GPT-5.6-Cyber 已在 Chrome V8 引擎中发现高危漏洞（CVE-2026-15903），并在移动操作系统、数据库及内核中识别出数百个潜在漏洞。Daybreak 计划提供分级访问权限：Daybreak Blue 移除部分系统级防护栏以适配通用防御，Daybreak Red 则面向高风险漏洞研究。为管控风险，OpenAI 实施了多层身份验证及硬件安全密钥强制要求，并建议客户启用自动审查模式以拦截高破坏性操作。该模型标志着 AI 驱动</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta正式开源30B稠密多模态模型Muse Glimmer并支持本地部署</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正式发布并开源30B参数的稠密多模态模型Muse Glimmer，这是继Llama 4后Meta再次向公众开放模型权重。该模型采用Apache 2.0许可证，专为本地智能体工作流优化，具备强大的文本处理、视觉能力及复杂多步推理与工具调用表现。在硬件适配上，Muse Glimmer通过4-bit量化可压缩至20GB以下，能在配备24GB或32GB显存的消费级硬件上流畅运行。结合DFlash块级投机解码技术，该模型在RTX 5090等硬件上的吞吐量实现数倍提升。在智能体任务及MCP Atlas基准测试中，该模型表现领先。扎克伯格表示将坚定支持开源路线，并预告基础模型Muse Spark 1.2的权重将在未来几周内陆续开放。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic科研版Claude挑战黎曼猜想，将zeta函数零点比例下界提升至67.2%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f39d013c609928964b3655cf21265248.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic公司的一款未发布科研版Claude在挑战黎曼猜想时，虽未攻克该世纪难题，但成功将黎曼zeta函数临界线零点的比例下界从41.6%提升至67.2%。此次科研突破并非依靠传统搜索，而是由Claude调度约60个子Agent组成“虚拟科研团队”，通过数百次自主试错、海量文献查阅及经典方法重组，在未知数学领域探索出创新边界。专家指出，该成果展示了AI在复杂长程任务、多代理协作及自主错误验证方面的硬核实力。此研究预示未来科研工作流将发生变革，AI通过承担高强度试错与交叉组合任务，能显著降低人类在未知领域的边际搜索成本，开启科研探索新纪元。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic与Riot签署91亿美元算力长单，锁定至2048年</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic与比特币矿企Riot Platforms达成一项价值91亿美元的长期云计算合约，协议期限长达20年。该合约涵盖Riot位于得克萨斯州Rockdale数据中心园区的191兆瓦算力供应。若双方行使两次各五年的延期选项，合同总价值最高可达161亿美元，协议有效期将延续至2048年6月。此举是Anthropic近期激进算力布局的一部分，此前该公司已与Volta Infra Holdings签署100亿美元协议，并与xAI达成450亿美元算力采购合作，三笔交易总额超600亿美元。这一系列动作反映了AI企业在算力供给端的持续压力，旨在通过锁定长期基础设施资源，保障Claude系列模型的算力需求。受此消息影响，Riot股价盘后大涨25%，触及24.40美元。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
